  "title": "Dashboard UI Quality System Registry",
  "status": "active",
  "owner": "nous-hermes-agent",
  "purpose": "Enumerate and enforce the full UI-quality operating system beyond domain libraries so dashboard work improves systematically across tokens, copy, layout, interaction, proof, scoring, debt, deprecation, human review, and agent build protocol.",
