    "declared design input and reference pattern",
    "approved domain library and wrapper when domain-native behavior exists",
    "approved component variant and layout pattern",
    "interaction and data-state contracts",
    "token-compatible visual implementation",
    "rendered proof across required states and viewports",
    "family-level UI quality score",
    "project adoption and migration evidence",
    "CI gate pass or explicit non-expired exception",
    "design debt and deprecated-pattern scan clean for the promoted route",
    "human review record for material visual changes",
    "agent build protocol checklist completed",
    "every production dashboard route registered with page-level intent, blueprint, density, spacing, card, table, drawer, and proof contracts",
    "all governed pages use approved spacing and card-content tokens instead of local one-off card padding, grid gaps, or dense content dumps"
  ],
